UID:10004046-1777806000-1777809600@www.unioncong.org
SUMMARY:Second Hour with Circles Leader Shanequa Ginn (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:Shanequa Ginn is a woman who has faced many obstacles throughout her life\, including periods of homelessness. Throughout\, her deep faith in God and passion for the examples of Jesus have sustained her in her journey. The one thing she has prayed for\, which she has found since joining PALS (fka Circles)\, is the sense of belonging to a true community of deeply caring and supportive friends. She is looking forward to sharing her experiences with you and is grateful for the opportunity\, as her goal is to help others by becoming a motivational speaker.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/second-hour-guild-room/
LOCATION:Guild Room
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events,Justice & Community Engagement
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
